#: ../../index.rst:1180
msgid ""
"SID 0010, review history (security review, 2026-10-15): the standard "
"bounded channel against the Vyukov ring, ``tests/timing.rs``. The opt-in "
"modules are ``crates/crypto/src/sha256/`` (x86-64 and AArch64), "
"``crates/crypto/src/ct.rs``, ``cmd/sibuna/src/signals.rs``, "
"``cmd/sibuna-pow-wasm/src/lib.rs``, ``cmd/console-ui/src/abi.rs`` and "
"``crates/store/src/ring.rs``; the workspace sets ``unsafe_code = "
"\"deny\"`` and Clippy's ``undocumented_unsafe_blocks = \"deny\"``."
msgstr ""
"SID 0010, historial de revisiones (revisión de seguridad, 2026-10-15): el "
"canal acotado estándar frente al anillo de Vyukov, ``tests/timing.rs``. "
"Los módulos que lo habilitan son ``crates/crypto/src/sha256/`` (x86-64 y "
"AArch64), ``crates/crypto/src/ct.rs``, ``cmd/sibuna/src/signals.rs``, "
"``cmd/sibuna-pow-wasm/src/lib.rs``, ``cmd/console-ui/src/abi.rs`` y "
"``crates/store/src/ring.rs``; el workspace fija ``unsafe_code = "
"\"deny\"`` y el ``undocumented_unsafe_blocks = \"deny\"`` de Clippy."
